class SkipEnqueueingSameTaskScheduler(Scheduler):
    """ This huey scheduler will skip enqueueing task if same type task is already running or scheduled. """

    def _is_same_task_pending_or_running(self, task_name: str):
            # not good, this method only checks if a task is pending for now
            for enqueued_task_data in self.huey.storage.enqueued_items():
                pending_task_name = self.huey.serializer.deserialize(enqueued_task_data).name
                if task_name == pending_task_name:
                    return True
            return False

    @override
    def enqueue_periodic_tasks(self, now):
       # .....
```

But it is only for pending tasks, I'd like to ask if there is anyway to get running tasks' information?  

My goal is simple: implement a scheduler, check if same task is running or pending before dispatching a periodic task, if so, do not enqueue the periodic task for now.

